{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6015004010010","name":"甜花","text":"……ひと、ひと……\r\nひと──……","trans":"……人、人……\n人——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004010020","name":"甜花","text":"──ひゃわっ！？","trans":"——哇啊！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004010030","name":"甜花","text":"……あ……\r\nぷ、プロデューサーさん……！","trans":"……啊……\n制、制作人……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004010040","name":"甜花","text":"ど……どうしよ……\r\nて、甜花、結構……緊張……","trans":"怎……怎么办……\n甜花，相当……紧张……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"落ち着け、甜花","trans":"冷静点，甜花","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"甜花、ランニングで体力もつけたし\r\nたくさんレッスンもしてきただろ？","trans":"甜花，你也通过跑步锻炼了体力\n还做了很多练习吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004010050","name":"甜花","text":"そ……\r\nそう……だね……！","trans":"对……\n对哦……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ\r\nだから、緊張しなくても大丈夫だ","trans":"嗯\n所以，不用紧张也没关系","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──頑張れ、甜花！","trans":"——加油，甜花！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6015004010060","name":"甜花","text":"にへへ……\r\nうん……ありがと……！","trans":"嘿嘿……\n嗯……谢谢……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}